  ('— Tour guide: The castle was built in the twelfth century by the Normans. — Tourist: ---- — Tour guide: Of course. The twelfth century. About nine hundred years ago. Diyaloğu anlamlı biçimde tamamlayan seçenek hangisidir?', 'Sorry, could you repeat that?', ['Sorry, could you take a photo?', 'Sorry, I\'ve seen this castle before.', 'Sorry, where are the toilets?'], 'Rehberin bilgiyi tekrarlaması turistin tekrar istediğini gösterir.'),
