  ('— Cashier: Your total is £8.20. — Customer: Here\'s a ten. — Cashier: ---- Which option best completes the dialogue?', 'Thanks. Here\'s £1.80 change.', ['Thanks. Here\'s £2.80 change.', 'Thanks. You need 80p more.', 'Thanks. That\'s exactly right.'], '10 − 8,20 = 1,80; kasiyer müşteriye 1,80 sterlin para üstü verir.'),
  ('— Taxi driver: That\'s £14.50. — Passenger: Here\'s fifteen. ---- — Driver: Thanks very much. Hangisi diyalogdaki boşluğu en iyi doldurur?', 'Keep the change.', ['Can I have a receipt?', 'Change the money, please.', 'Give me the rest back.'], 'Yolcu para üstünü bahşiş olarak bırakıyor; \'Keep the change\' \'Üstü kalsın\' demektir.'),
